  "instructions": [
    "heat vegetable oil in a large saucepan over medium heat",
    "add diced onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes",
    "add minced garlic and sauté for another minute",
    "add diced carrots and cook for 5 minutes, or until they start to soften",
    "add basmati rice and cook for 2-3 minutes, stirring constantly",
    "add elderflower syrup, pickle juice, salt, and black pepper",
    "stir well and bring to a boil",
    "reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15-20 minutes, or until the rice is cooked and the liquid has been absorbed",
    "fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve hot"
